  "description": "Adds a message map for the HL7 v2 PPR_PC1 structure (PC1, problem add; http://hl7.org/v2/StructureDefinition/PPR_PC1), for which hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0 ships none. The rows are those of ConceptMap/message-oru-r01-to-bundle for MSH, SFT, PID, PV1 and PV2 (the visit under PATIENT_VISIT), and its result OBX rows for the OBX of PROBLEM.PROBLEM_OBSERVATION. The guide ships no segment map for PRB, PRD, CTD, VAR, PTH or GOL, so the problem itself stays counted as unmapped, and the ORC and OBR of PROBLEM.ORDER, which no map of the guide places in a problem message, stay unmapped too. FerroBRIDGE #637.",
